{"seq":2,"slug":"laboratory-diagnostics","title":"大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/laboratory-diagnostics","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-实验室诊断\">大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>实验室诊断通过对血液、尿液、体液等标本的生化、免疫和微生物学分析为临床决策提供客观数据。每一项检验结果都需要结合临床背景解读——脱离病史的实验室数值没有独立诊断意义。理解检验的敏感度、特异度和预测值是正确使用实验室检查的方法论基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"血常规\">血常规</h3><p>血常规（complete blood count, CBC）是最基础、最常用的实验室检查，一管 EDTA 抗凝静脉血即可获得红细胞、白细胞和血小板三大系列的定量信息。</p>\n<p><strong>白细胞分类计数的临床解读</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>正常参考值</th>\n<th>升高常见原因</th>\n<th>降低常见原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WBC 总数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}10 \\times 10^9/\\text{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>细菌感染、炎症、应激</td>\n<td>病毒感染、再障、化疗后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性粒细胞（N）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\text{-}70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>急性细菌感染、组织坏死</td>\n<td>粒细胞缺乏（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.5 \\times 10^9/\\text{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为严重）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>淋巴细胞（L）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{-}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>病毒感染、慢性感染、淋巴瘤</td>\n<td>HIV、糖皮质激素使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嗜酸性粒细胞（E）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>过敏性疾病、寄生虫感染</td>\n<td>急性感染早期（应激性↓）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单核细胞（M）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>慢性感染（结核）、单核细胞白血病</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>贫血的实验室分类</strong>依据红细胞平均体积（MCV）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>小细胞低色素性贫血</strong>（MCV <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>80</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>fL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 80\\,\\text{fL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fL</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：缺铁性贫血（最常见）、地中海贫血</li>\n<li><strong>正细胞正色素性贫血</strong>（MCV <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>fL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\text{-}100\\,\\text{fL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fL</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：慢性病贫血、急性失血、溶血性贫血</li>\n<li><strong>大细胞性贫血</strong>（MCV <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>fL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 100\\,\\text{fL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fL</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：巨幼细胞贫血（叶酸/维生素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缺乏）、MDS</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缺铁性贫血的&quot;铁四项&quot;特征模式：血清铁（SI）↓、总铁结合力（TIBC）↑、转铁蛋白饱和度↓、血清铁蛋白（SF）↓。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>g/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF &lt; 12\\,\\mu\\text{g/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是诊断缺铁的金标准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"肝功能检查\">肝功能检查</h3><p>肝功能检查反映肝细胞损伤和肝脏合成/排泄功能：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>正常参考值</th>\n<th>反映功能</th>\n<th>升高的临床意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ALT</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>U/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 40\\,\\text{U/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">U/L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肝细胞损伤（最敏感）</td>\n<td>肝炎、药物性肝损伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AST</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>U/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 40\\,\\text{U/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">U/L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肝细胞损伤 + 心肌损伤</td>\n<td>AST/ALT <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 提示酒精性肝病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总胆红素（TBIL）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>17.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 17.1\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>胆红素代谢</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>34.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 34.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">34.2</span></span></span></span></span> 时出现临床可见黄疸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接胆红素（DBIL）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>6.8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 6.8\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>胆汁排泄</td>\n<td>DBIL 为主↑ → 梗阻性黄疸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白蛋白（ALB）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>55</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\text{-}55\\,\\text{g/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肝脏合成功能</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 30\\,\\text{g/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 提示严重肝功能不全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凝血酶原时间（PT）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>13</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11\\text{-}13\\,\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>凝血因子合成</td>\n<td>PT 延长提示肝脏合成功能受损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>黄疸的鉴别诊断思路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[黄疸 TBIL↑] --&gt; B{DBIL/TBIL 比值}&#10;    B --&gt;|&lt; 20%| C[溶血性黄疸: 间接胆红素为主]&#10;    B --&gt;|20-50%| D[肝细胞性黄疸: ALT/AST 显著↑]&#10;    B --&gt;|&gt; 50%| E[梗阻性黄疸: ALP/GGT 显著↑]&#10;    C --&gt; F[网织红细胞↑, LDH↑, 结合珠蛋白↓]&#10;    D --&gt; G[病毒性肝炎, 药物性肝损伤]&#10;    E --&gt; H[胆管结石, 胰头癌, 胆管癌]\">graph TD\n    A[黄疸 TBIL↑] --&gt; B{DBIL/TBIL 比值}\n    B --&gt;|&lt; 20%| C[溶血性黄疸: 间接胆红素为主]\n    B --&gt;|20-50%| D[肝细胞性黄疸: ALT/AST 显著↑]\n    B --&gt;|&gt; 50%| E[梗阻性黄疸: ALP/GGT 显著↑]\n    C --&gt; F[网织红细胞↑, LDH↑, 结合珠蛋白↓]\n    D --&gt; G[病毒性肝炎, 药物性肝损伤]\n    E --&gt; H[胆管结石, 胰头癌, 胆管癌]</pre><h3 id=\"肾功能检查\">肾功能检查</h3><p>肾功能评估的核心指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>血清肌酐（Scr）</strong>：正常男性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>53</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>106</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">53\\text{-}106\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">53</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">106</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，女性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>97</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44\\text{-}97\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">97</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>。肌酐由肌肉代谢产生，经肾小球滤过排出。但 Scr 在 GFR 下降至正常的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 之前可能仍处于正常范围——存在&quot;肌酐盲区&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>估算肾小球滤过率（eGFR）</strong>：使用 CKD-EPI 公式（基于年龄、性别、Scr），比单一肌酐值更准确反映肾功能</li>\n<li><strong>尿常规 + 尿微量白蛋白</strong>：尿蛋白阳性是肾脏损害的早期信号；尿微量白蛋白/肌酐比值（UACR）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg/g</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 30\\,\\text{mg/g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/g</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为白蛋白尿，是糖尿病肾病筛查的核心指标</li>\n</ul>\n<p>慢性肾脏病（CKD）分期：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分期</th>\n<th>eGFR（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>mL/min/1.73m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{mL/min/1.73m}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL/min/1.73m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肾功能正常（伴有肾损伤证据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>89</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\text{-}89</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">89</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G3a</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>59</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45\\text{-}59</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">59</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻-中度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G3b</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}44</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">44</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中-重度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G4</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>29</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}29</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">29</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>重度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>肾衰竭（需透析或移植）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"心肌损伤标志物\">心肌损伤标志物</h3><p>急性冠脉综合征（ACS）的实验室诊断核心是<strong>高敏肌钙蛋白</strong>（hs-cTnI 或 hs-cTnT）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>心肌细胞坏死后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> h 开始升高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h 达峰</li>\n<li>灵敏度极高——hs-cTn 在症状发作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> h 即可检出</li>\n<li><strong>0/1h 或 0/3h 快速排除流程</strong>：入院即刻 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> h（或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> h）两次采血，hs-cTn 均低于截断值且变化幅度（delta）极小→可安全排除心梗</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其他标志物的定位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标志物</th>\n<th>升高时间</th>\n<th>达峰时间</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>hs-cTnI/T</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> d</td>\n<td>ACS 诊断/排除金标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CK-MB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> d</td>\n<td>判断再梗死（因回落更快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BNP/NT-proBNP</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>心衰诊断和严重程度分级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"炎症与感染标志物\">炎症与感染标志物</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>C 反应蛋白（CRP）</strong>：急性时相蛋白，感染/炎症后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\text{-}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> h 开始升高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> h 达峰。细菌感染时显著升高（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 100\\,\\text{mg/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>），病毒感染时仅轻度升高</li>\n<li><strong>降钙素原（PCT）</strong>：对细菌感染（尤其脓毒症）更具特异性。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ng/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 0.5\\,\\text{ng/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ng/mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 强烈提示细菌感染，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ng/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2\\,\\text{ng/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ng/mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 提示脓毒症。PCT 可用于指导抗菌药物的降阶梯和停药</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位患者血常规示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Hb = 85\\,\\text{g/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，MCV <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>68</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>fL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 68\\,\\text{fL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">68</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，MCH <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>pg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 22\\,\\text{pg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pg</span></span></span></span></span></span>。请判断贫血类型，列出最可能的两种疾病，并说明下一步需要检查哪些指标来鉴别。</li>\n<li>一位黄疸患者检查结果：TBIL <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 120\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，DBIL <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>95</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>mol/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 95\\,\\mu\\text{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，ALT <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>U/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 50\\,\\text{U/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">U/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，ALP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>U/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 450\\,\\text{U/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">450</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">U/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>，GGT <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>380</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>U/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 380\\,\\text{U/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">380</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">U/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>。请判断黄疸类型，并推测最可能的病因。</li>\n<li>急诊来了一位胸痛 2 小时的患者，第一次 hs-cTnI <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ng/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 8\\,\\text{ng/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ng/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>（正常上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ng/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26\\,\\text{ng/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ng/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>），1 小时后复查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ng/L</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 10\\,\\text{ng/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ng/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>。根据 0/1h 排除流程，能否安全排除急性心肌梗死？为什么？</li>\n<li>对比 CRP 和 PCT 在区分细菌感染与病毒感染中的临床价值差异。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Henry&#39;s Clinical Diagnosis and Management by Laboratory Methods</strong>：实验诊断学经典参考书。</li>\n<li><strong>Wallach&#39;s Interpretation of Diagnostic Tests</strong>：按疾病和检验项目双向索引编排，便于临床快速查阅。</li>\n<li><strong>UpToDate — Laboratory Test Interpretation</strong>：各项检验的临床解读和循证推荐。</li>\n<li><strong>Labtestsonline.org</strong>（AACC 主办）：面向医学生和患者的实验室检查科普平台，每项检查配有简明解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>实验室诊断的核心能力是&quot;从数字中读出临床故事&quot;：血常规通过 WBC 分类和 MCV 将感染类型和贫血病因分层；肝功能检查通过胆红素比值和转氨酶模式区分黄疸类型；肾功能评估从单一肌酐进化到 eGFR 以消除肌酐盲区；心肌标志物的连续监测使 ACS 的快速排除成为可能。每一项检验都有其&quot;窗口期&quot;和&quot;盲区&quot;——理解这些局限性与记住正常参考值同样重要。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断","id":"大学临床医学-实验室诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"血常规","id":"血常规"},{"level":3,"text":"肝功能检查","id":"肝功能检查"},{"level":3,"text":"肾功能检查","id":"肾功能检查"},{"level":3,"text":"心肌损伤标志物","id":"心肌损伤标志物"},{"level":3,"text":"炎症与感染标志物","id":"炎症与感染标志物"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 体格检查","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/physical-examination"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 医学影像学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/medical-imaging"}}